@baseUrl = http://localhost:3021

### Test app help
GET {{baseUrl}}/help

### Test DB health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/mysql

### Test stage entities
GET {{baseUrl}}/clinicminds/stage/entities

### Test reports catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports

### Run patient stage against test fixtures
POST {{baseUrl}}/clinicminds/stage/cmPatient
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Run material treatment stage against test fixtures
POST {{baseUrl}}/clinicminds/stage/cmMaterialTreatment
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Preview invoice amounts report
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/invoice-amounts/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceDateFrom": "2026-07-01",
  "invoiceDateTo": "2026-07-31"
}

### Download invoice amounts CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/invoice-amounts/download?format=csv&invoiceDateFrom=2026-07-01&invoiceDateTo=2026-07-31

### Download invoice amounts XLSX
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/invoice-amounts/download?format=xlsx&invoiceDateFrom=2026-07-01&invoiceDateTo=2026-07-31
